sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-19-petroff-kahng-second-assessor-audit-petroff-stromatolite-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Petroff et al. (2010) Conical Stromatolite Spacing Law & Dome-to-Cone Morphospace — Morphometric validation: 15/100" ;
        rdfs:comment "Only one morphometric is computed, aspect_ratio (L165-171), which the docstring notes is used only to annotate the figure, and it is compared with nothing measured. The shaded 0.5-1.5 cm band (L198) stands in for the paper's measured spacing distributions without data, and no lamina-thickness, apex-angle, or crest-zone-width metric is computed. Evidence: 2010-petroff-stromatolite.py L165–L171: aspect_ratio height/width with no reference comparison <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5564750/2010-petroff-stromatolite.py#L165-L171>; 2010-petroff-stromatolite.py L198–L198: unsourced axhspan(0.5, 1.5) band <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5564750/2010-petroff-stromatolite.py#L198-L198>. Measurements (measure_outputs.py): field cone spacing ell at tau = 12 h (D = 1e-5 cm^2/s, alpha = 1.0) = 0.6573 cm (reference 1.0, Petroff et al. 2010 PNAS 107(22):9956-9961 Eq. 2 (~1 cm Yellowstone field spacing)) [diffusion_length(12 * 3600, D=1e-5, alpha=1.0) = alpha * sqrt(D * tau)] — lab clumps (alpha=0.30) ell(12 h) = 0.1972 cm; hex_lattice min NN distance = 0.6573 cm; dome regime (beta = 0.3) final lamina height/width aspect ratio = 0.6692 height/width [aspect_ratio(grow_stromatolite(v=0.3, lam=1.0)[-1])]; cone regime (beta = 1.5) final lamina height/width aspect ratio = 1.1696 height/width [aspect_ratio(grow_stromatolite(v=1.5, lam=1.0)[-1])]; sharp cone regime (beta = 5.0) final lamina height/width aspect ratio = 2.6191 height/width [aspect_ratio(grow_stromatolite(v=5.0, lam=1.0)[-1])] — monotonic aspect-ratio progression across beta=(0.3, 1.5, 5.0): 0.669 < 1.170 < 2.619." ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:evaluatesHypothesis <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-petroff-stromatolite-morphometric-validation> ;
        pk:hasProbability "0.15"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "not faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-petroff-stromatolite-morphometric-validation> rdfs:label "Petroff et al. (2010) Conical Stromatolite Spacing Law & Dome-to-Cone Morphospace (2010-petroff-stromatolite.py, docs/media/petroff_stromatolite_dome_to_cone.gif) satisfies the MorphoEval 0.1.0 criterion 'Morphometric validation' for Photosynthetic microbial mats and conical stromatolites (Conophyton / Yellowstone modern mats)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Claude Fable 5.1 (Cursor subagent e65a3d81-92b5-4bb2-941f-4566032cb3cd, blinded second assessor)" .
}

